			"notes": "**Changelog**\n\n- Port to 1.20\n- Fix bug where option sliders would not display properly on first loading\n- Add debug features\n- Fix bug where the default osmium cape would render too fast\n- Technical changes with how screens are created and rendered\n- Updated the color select widget to be more reliable on different screen resolutions\n- Remove server side osmium features\n\n**Why Remove Server Sided Features?**\n\nUnfortunately, the cost to development time ratio for server sided features was very high, and the likelihood they would ever be useful is very slim, so I made the decision to stop supporting them.\n\n**Why The Lack of Updates?**\n\nI don't have the time anymore, and the mod is pretty much finished and without major bugs."
